 "remarks": "Newly Reduced ! Available (furnished or unfurnished)! Discover this move-in-ready one-bedroom condo perfectly situated in the heart of Downtown Stamford. Located on the first floor, this unit offers a bright and inviting open layout with a well-equipped eat-in kitchen, a spacious living area, and the convenience of an in-unit washer and dryer.  Residents enjoy a host of amenities, including a newly updated community patio with BBQ grills, tables, and seating-ideal for outdoor gatherings-along with an on-site fitness center, a dedicated parking spot, a live-in superintendent, and a warm, welcoming lobby.  Just steps outside your door, you'll find Stamford's top restaurants, shops, and public transportation, making everyday living, commuting, and entertainment effortless.  An unbeatable location-come see it for yourself! Available for furnished at $2500/month",
